campfire-examine-lit = The fire is burning.
campfire-examine-unlit = The fire is not lit.
campfire-examine-fuel-empty = There is no fuel in it.
campfire-examine-time-embers = About 1-3 minutes left.
campfire-examine-time-low = About 4-7 minutes left.
campfire-examine-time-medium = About 7-10 minutes left.
campfire-examine-time-high = About 10-12 minutes left.
campfire-examine-time-full = About 13-15 minutes left.
campfire-no-fuel = There is nothing to burn, add some wood or cloth first.
campfire-ignite = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } lights { THE($fire) }.
campfire-full = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } can't hold any more fuel.
campfire-add-fuel = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } feeds { THE($item) } to the fire.
campfire-burned-out = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } burns out.
campfire-verb-stomp = Stamp out the fire
campfire-suffocated = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } goes out without air.
campfire-stomp-start = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } starts stamping out { THE($fire) }.
campfire-stomped = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } stamps out { THE($fire) }.
campfire-stomp-burned = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } is blazing too fiercely, you catch fire!
campfire-not-enough-water = Not enough water, at least { $amount } units are needed to douse the fire.
campfire-doused = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } hisses and goes out.
campfire-sprayed = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } hisses but keeps burning.
